### E-Commerce Inventory & Order API — Full Collection (Week 1, 2 & Categories)
### Test with VS Code REST Client extension or import into Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### =======================================================
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### =======================================================

### Check API Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### =======================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & AUTHORIZATION (TASK 2.1)
### =======================================================

### 2.1 Register New User
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "username": "adalove_test",
  "email": "ada_test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.2 Login User & Get JWT
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store token dynamically from login response:
@token = {{loginUser.response.body.data.token}}

### 2.3 Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2.4 Test 401 Unauthorized (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### =======================================================
### 3. CATEGORIES (4th Entity)
### =======================================================

### 3.1 List All Categories (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 3.2 Get Single Category by ID (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/1

### 3.3 Create a Category (Protected)
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Computer peripherals and electronic accessories"
}

### Store category ID dynamically:
@categoryId = {{createCategory.response.body.category.id}}

### 3.4 Get All Products in a Category (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 3.5 Update a Category (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated description — laptops, keyboards, mice"
}

### 3.6 Delete a Category (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =======================================================
### 4. PRODUCTS (CATALOG MANAGEMENT)
### =======================================================

### 4.1 List All Products (Public, Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 4.2 Get Single Product by ID (Shows category_name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### 4.3 Create Product Linked to a Category (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB",
  "description": "Hot-swappable 75% mechanical keyboard with PBT keycaps",
  "price": 99.99,
  "stock": 30,
  "category_id": 1
}

### 4.4 Update Product (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 84.99,
  "stock": 28
}

### 4.5 Delete Product (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =======================================================
### 5. RELATIONSHIPS & ORDERS (TASK 2.2)
### =======================================================

### 5.1 Place Order (Deducts Stock & Calculates Total)
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Store order ID dynamically:
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.data.id}}

### 5.2 Test 400 Insufficient Stock
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 9999
}

### 5.3 Get Authenticated User's Orders (1:N Relationship)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my-orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.4 Get Single Order Details (Ownership Check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.5 Cancel Order (Restores Stock back to Product)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
